      "role": "user",
      "content": "i don't know if naming it does anything. it just feels like there's nothing underneath the surface. like if i stopped trying to hold on to things, i'd just... dissolve. and maybe that's what's actually supposed to happen. just fading out until there's nothing left to carry the weight.",
